Orin had honed his intution for differential signaling when learning about Laplace Transforms. Problems that seem insurmountable in one framing become simple with the right point of view. In hindsight, collecting photons through time and not just space seemed so simple. Yet it was an approach that few had tried - the sensitivity of pixels couldn't possibly detect individual photons (like the human eye), so no one had even considered the possibility of un-tangling billions of photons using differential signaling. Until Orin's STS.October 4, 2025
