The Visible Hand returned to Orin in a dream last night. He saw it stretched not just across Earth and Mars, but throughout the cosmos. A Galactic Empire awaited humanity, if only Orin could convince everyone to stop competing for scrarce resources. Everything humans needed for survival was actually abundant - just not locally.

Earth, Mars, and Venus could cradle perhaps 30B humans with proper terraforming and maintenance - but Orin's future vision required trillions of humans.

