He had a vague sense of uneasiness the rest of the afternoon. He decided to channel his anxiety into making improvements upon the STS. He realized that he could hand-tune a stepper-motor platform using a microscope to achieve 0.125 micrometer resolution with a two-tier stepper motor setup. His kitchen table had stopped resembling an eating surface - it was now full on inventor mode.October 6, 2025
