Orin invented the TCP/IP of things by considering shipping from first principles. Where Amazon or Walmart saw inefficiency (pallets vs single box shipments), Orin saw fractal Tetris. The effort of packing and re-packing for shipping containers and pallets could be avoided entirely if FedEx and UPS had simply planned for TCP-based delivery.October 7, 2025
