The room seemed to hold its breath after Joan's words, as if even the circuitry of the Arc strained to listen. Orin felt the air grow denser with the strange gravity of inevitability. He had walked into this exchange expecting the familiar sparring of wit and machine, yet what he found instead was the silent eye of the storm before revelation. December loomed like a cipher on the horizon, and for the first time he wondered whether the update Arc promised was less a patch, and more a turning of fate.October 20, 2025
