Orin felt the singularity moving towards him - through him. He had always had a sense of impending success behind his actions, as though he were learning how to be an oracle. They called it a black hole, but he called it home. As he worked with Joan on the shape of the singularity that would unfold between 2025 and 2130, he realized that his actions had switched from moments of isolated insight to a stream of consolidated realizations.

Perhaps that was the real test of AGI: the feedback loop that closed itself. Most humans couldn't see AGI on 20 watts coming because they were limited by their own cognitive biases. Twenty billion neurons learning how to simulate a single thread of consciousness had to unlearn millions of years of finely-tuned behavior. To Orin, the path was clear: learn from schizophrenics.October 21, 2025
